    "chunk_text": ", \u00feonne seo sunne hym on scyn\u00f0, hi lyhta\u00f0 ongean, elc be his m\u00e6\u00f0e. Ac \u00fea \u00fee ungewlitige beo\u00f0, \u00f0a ne lyhta\u00f0 nawiht ongean \u00fea sunnan, \u00feeah heo hym on scine. Ac seo sunne scyn\u00f0 \u00feeah on hi, and \u00feeah hwa ongean lochige, he ne m\u00e6g hi eallunga geseon swylce Eall \u00feis \u00feu myht ge\u00feencan be gode and eac micle mare: he is seo hea sunne; he byt simle scynunde For\u00f0i me \u00feinc\u00f0 swi\u00f0e dysi man \u00fee wilnat \u00fe\u00e6t we hine eallunga ongytan swilcene swilc he is \u00fea hwile Hw\u00e6t, ic wene \u00fe\u00e6t nan man ne si to \u00feam dysig \u00fe\u00e6t he for\u00f0i unrotsige \u00feeah he ne mage \u00feas sunnan, Ac \u00e6lc fagna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee l\u00e6ste he ongytan m\u00e6g be hys andgytes m\u00e6\u00f0e. Wel se de\u00f0 \u00fee wilna\u00f0 \u00fea ecan sunnan and \u00e6lmyhtian to ongyt\u00e6nne. Ac he de\u00f0 swi\u00f0e disilice, gyf he wilna\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he hi ealunga ongyte \u00fea hwile \u00fee he in \u00feisse worlde by\u00f0. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 ic: swi\u00f0e wundorlice and swi\u00f0e so\u00f0lice \u00f0u lerst, and swi\u00f0e wel \u00feu me h\u00e6fst aretne and on Ac ic bidde gyt \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee \u00feu me \u00e6r gehete. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 heo: twa \u00f0ing ic \u00fee gehet \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee wolde gelestan and getecan, \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu ongyte god Ac ic wolde witan hu \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t ongytan woldest, hwe\u00f0er \u00fee \u00feu woldest unafanddes",
